WEBVTT

00:07:29.432 --> 00:07:32.077
(Laughter)

00:07:32.101 --> 00:07:35.674
Let me give you
a sample from our research.

00:07:35.698 --> 00:07:41.046
So this ad that I witnessed
essentially triggered a research project

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:44.022
with my PhD student, Hemant,
over the next two years.

00:07:44.732 --> 00:07:46.538
And in one of these studies,

00:07:46.562 --> 00:07:51.087
we presented participants
an actual print ad

00:07:51.111 --> 00:07:52.849
that appeared in a magazine.

00:07:52.873 --> 00:07:54.539
[Soothing rest for mind and body.]

00:07:54.563 --> 00:07:59.016
You'll notice the last line
is devoted to the side effects

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:00.197
of this drug.